{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cb82d09eae8cc26ead6b62e0074c3e27636e2f3c4b8d515de01525a87b919155", "ja": "（仕事も落ち着いたし、帰ろうかな。\nん？　控え室の明かりがついてる……？）", "zh": "（工作也忙完了，回去吧。\n嗯？休息室的灯还亮着……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
